      "id": "claim_1550edd39a9a4466a5abffd9d489b8f7",
      "statement": "ForceOrg-40k / BeerHammer is a self-hosted Warhammer 40,000 11th Edition force-construction and tabletop combat console organised as an npm/Turborepo monorepo of apps/web (Next.js 14 App Router), apps/api (Express), apps/sync-worker (Wahapedia ETL) plus packages/types, ui-theme, rules-engine-11e and db-client.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L1-L13",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5e5ce07887da86eda48dce7a92c46e7dfd5ca82aab668bc4f57e726d3c743d00:"
