      "id": "claim_a92b04311b8c40ad8335a0630f988985",
      "statement": "The containerized boot path is `./scripts/dev.sh up`, the only host-side entry point (Docker is the sole host requirement); dev.sh shells out to `docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml` and dispatches subcommands (up, down, rebuild, verify, test, e2e-install, e2e, logs, shell, psql) into scripts/dev-container.sh inside the container, with WEB_PORT/API_PORT remapping the published ports.",
