      "statement": "The HTTP API is the only integration surface for external systems: read endpoints are public while write endpoints require a JWT signed with the instance's JWT_SECRET, and the stack (PostgreSQL 16 plus S3-compatible SeaweedFS) runs as local containers on one host.",
