      "statement": "A third supported boot path stands up the whole stack from published GHCR images with zero configuration: `docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml pull && up -d` starts postgres, SeaweedFS, the API and the web app with no checkout build and no .env, because every unset variable uses a `${VAR:-default}` fallback rather than a required-variable guard.",
