      "statement": "The three supported start paths serve distinct jobs rather than being interchangeable: `npm run dev` and `./scripts/dev.sh` are day-to-day development loops that carry the lint/build/test gate, while the pull-based prod composition (and `docker compose up --build` for source builds) provides a running full-stack test/hosting environment with no source toolchain.",
